      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw in the right hand of him that sat on the throne a book written within and on the back, close sealed with seven seals. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw a strong angel proclaiming with a great voice, Who is worthy to open the book, and to loose the seals thereof? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And no one in the heaven, or on the earth, or under the earth, was able to open the book, or to look thereon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I wept much, because no one was found worthy to open the book, or to look thereon: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and one of the elders saith unto me, Weep not; behold, the Lion that is of the tribe of Judah, the Root of David, hath overcome to open the book and the seven seals thereof. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw in the midst of the throne and of the four living creatures, and in the midst of the elders, a Lamb standing, as though it had been slain, having seven horns, and seven eyes, which are the seven Spirits of God, sent forth into all the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he came, and he taketh ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " out of the right hand of him that sat on the throne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when he had taken the book, the four living creatures and the four and twenty elders fell down before the Lamb, having each one a harp, and golden bowls full of incense, which are the prayers of the saints. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they sing a new song, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
